{%- comment -%}
  Furgenics — product-at-a-glance snippet
  Compact spec panel for the PDP buy box: the facts a groomer needs before
  opening anything (dilution, yield, live cost per working gallon, coat fit,
  size, origin/shipping/returns). Replaces the earlier one-line
  "price economics" custom_liquid block (which used the cup-of-coffee
  narrative) with concrete, Markets-aware numbers.

  Usage (custom_liquid block in templates/product.json, after `price`):
    {% render 'product-at-a-glance', product: product %}

  Data sources — nothing hardcoded that can drift:
  - Dilution + yield: [[VALUE:dilution-ratio]] / [[VALUE:working-gallons-per-bottle]]
    via snippets/token-substitution.liquid (single source of truth).
  - Cost per working gallon: computed at render time from the live variant
    price ÷ 17 — always current, per-market currency. KEEP THE DIVISOR IN SYNC
    with the working-gallons-per-bottle VALUE in token-substitution.liquid.
  - Coat fit: custom.coat_type metafield (coat-types clause, before "Dog types:").
  - Shipping windows: per Stephen 2026-08-14 — CA 2–5 business days,
    US 3–5 business days (canonical, see products.md).
  - Returns: 30-day refund-only policy (products.md).
  - "1 gallon / 128 oz": invariant for the gallon line; the gallon gate below
    keeps this snippet off samples/legacy products.

  Gate: renders only when the description carries the dilution VALUE token —
  i.e. gallon concentrates. Samples and legacy products render nothing.

  Deferred to Phase 2 (needs new per-SKU metafields documented in products.md
  first): contact time, per-SKU "best for" display line.
{%- endcomment -%}

{%- if product.description contains '[[VALUE:dilution-ratio]]' -%}
  {%- assign _working_gallons = 17.0 -%}
  {%- assign _per_gallon = product.selected_or_first_available_variant.price | divided_by: _working_gallons | round -%}
  {%- assign _coat_fit = product.metafields.custom.coat_type.value | split: 'Dog types:' | first | strip -%}

  <div class="furgenics-at-a-glance">
    <ul>
      <li><strong>{% render 'token-substitution', text: '[[VALUE:dilution-ratio]]' %}</strong> &middot; {% render 'token-substitution', text: '[[VALUE:working-gallons-per-bottle]]' %}</li>
      <li><strong>&asymp; {{ _per_gallon | money }} per working gallon</strong> at professional dilution</li>
      {%- if _coat_fit != blank -%}
        <li><strong>Best for:</strong> {{ _coat_fit }}</li>
      {%- endif -%}
      <li><strong>1 gallon / 128 oz</strong> professional size</li>
      <li>
        Made in Canada &middot;
        {%- if localization.country.iso_code == 'US' %}
          ships in 3&ndash;5 business days
        {%- else %}
          ships in 2&ndash;5 business days
        {%- endif %}
        &middot; 30-day refund policy
      </li>
    </ul>
  </div>

  <style>
    .furgenics-at-a-glance { margin: 12px 0 4px; padding: 12px 16px; border: 1px solid #e5e5e5; border-radius: 8px; }
    .furgenics-at-a-glance ul { list-style: none; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
    .furgenics-at-a-glance li { padding: 4px 0; font-size: 0.95em; line-height: 1.45; }
    .furgenics-at-a-glance li + li { border-top: 1px solid #f0f0f0; }
  </style>
{%- endif -%}
